  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "You have a matrix AAA with dimensions N×NN \\times NN×N. Let the disgust of the matrix be defined as:\n\n∑i=1N∑j=1N(A(i,j)−A(j,i))2\\sum_{i=1}^{N} \\sum_{j=1}^{N} (A_{(i, j)} - A_{(j, i)})^2∑i=1N​∑j=1N​(A(i,j)​−A(j,i)​)2\n\nYou also have MMM tuples with you. Each tuple consists of 333 integers Xi,Yi,X_i, Y_i,Xi​,Yi​, ans ZiZ_iZi​ (1≤i≤M)(1\\le i \\le M)(1≤i≤M). In one operation, you can:\n\n\nChoose an element (p,q)(p, q)(p,q) (1≤p,q≤N)(1\\le p,q \\le N)(1≤p,q≤N) such that the value of the element A(p,q)=XiA_{(p,q)} = X_iA(p,q)​=Xi​.\nChange the value of the chosen element to YiY_iYi​.\nThe cost of applying the above operation is ZiZ_iZi​. Note that (1≤i≤M)(1 \\le i \\le M)(1≤i≤M) and thus, the operation might correspond to any one of the given tuples.\n\nFind the **minimum** value of (((totalCost +++ disgust))) after applying the given operation any (possibly zero) number of times.\n\n\nInput Format\n\nThe first line contains one integer TTT - the number of test cases. Then TTT test cases follow.\nThe first line of each test case consists of two integer NNN and MMM, the row size and the number of tuples.\nNNN lines follow, each consisting of NNN space-separated integers - the matrix AAA.\nMMM lines follow, each consisting of 333 space-separated integers - each tuple Xi,Yi,ZiX_i, Y_i, Z_iXi​,Yi​,Zi​.\n\n\nOutput Format\nFor each test case, output the **minimum** value of (((totalCost +++ disgust))) after applying the given operation any (possibly zero) number of times.",
    "constraints": [
      "1≤T≤1001 \\leq T \\leq 1001≤T≤100",
      "1≤N≤5001 \\leq N \\leq 5001≤N≤500",
      "1≤M≤1051 \\leq M \\leq 10^{5}1≤M≤105",
      "1≤A(i,j)≤N1 \\leq A_{(i, j)} \\leq N1≤A(i,j)​≤N for (1≤i,j≤N)(1\\le i, j \\le N)(1≤i,j≤N)",
      "1≤Xi,Yi≤N1 \\leq X_i, Y_i \\leq N1≤Xi​,Yi​≤N for (1≤i≤M)(1 \\le i \\le M)(1≤i≤M)",
      "1≤Zi≤1091 \\leq Z_i \\leq 10^91≤Zi​≤109 for (1≤i≤M)(1 \\le i \\le M)(1≤i≤M)",
      "It is guaranteed that the sum of NNN over all test cases does not exceed 500500500.",
      "It is guaranteed that the sum of MMM over all test cases does not exceed 10510^5105."
    ],
